NOTICE - Gemma model attribution
================================

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms.

The aisle-categorization model served by this project is a Gemma "Model
Derivative":
  - fine-tuned from EmbeddingGemma (google/embeddinggemma-300m), and
  - trained on base-aisle labels generated by Gemma (google/gemma-4-12B-it).

The model files have been modified from the original EmbeddingGemma:
fine-tuned end-to-end, then exported and quantized to an int8 ONNX graph.

